{"title":"2004 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/3/bb36deeba5bedb6ce63cf282e7527fa2fa9808a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/c/f0c134c94499ded899ebc903aa2ce88beca61eb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{3}{8} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ -\\frac{1}{6} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{5}{8} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{1}{16} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"402\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use a common denominator in this case.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/9/5a905158a0cc49faf19f98f4bb48d78626232626.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 = 2$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/e/71e1d81e9d43f49171477ca6e8a8f996ddda7d4f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 = 2^{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />, so we can see that the common denominator will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/a/a1a5c541e662d1983b18c81e16f2a03082296ba5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{1 \\times 4}{2 \\times 4} = \\frac{4}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"121\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/4/044132dc5f1e5428607170f76bca70ae273d14d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{8} = \\frac{1 \\times 1}{8 \\times 1} = \\frac{1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"121\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>We then see:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/0/1304af8b9d2f8d6cf83df1b54309be3a4c7e6779.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{8} = \\frac{4}{8} - \\frac{1}{8} = \\frac{4 - 1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"191\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/1/2c1434893ecf2fb42c194c678ed8e8e40decce4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } \\frac{3}{8}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"81\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2004 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2004 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2004 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2004 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\